# the WEAVE track: T2 set up to weave with T1 (ARP's Weave); on WEAVE, REC held and T2's key held while it plays
# writes a weave onto WEAVE's step 5 (8 sixteenths); its Steps: a step held, black key 5 adds T5, white key 12 its end
wait 300
hits 1 1 1 x...x...x...x...
notes 2 1 1 1 100 C4
notes 2 1 3 1 100 E4
notes 2 1 5 1 100 G4
notes 2 1 7 1 100 B4
turn ALGO 1
tap ARP
turn SELECT 2
tapkey b0
turn K3 2
turn ALGO 9
expect trk 13
tap EDIT
wait 50
shot wvt_page.png
tap PLAY
wait 300
press REC
wait 50
key w1 down
wait 1000
shot wvt_weaving.png
key w1 up
wait 200
release REC
wait 300
tap PLAY
weavesteps 1
expect weave 1 5 0x002 8
tap SEQ
wait 100
shot wvt_steps.png
key w8 down
wait 30
tapkey b4
tapkey w11
key w8 up
wait 50
weavesteps 1
expect weave 1 9 0x010 4
shot wvt_steps2.png
